sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant UI as Paper Upload Page
    participant Controller as PaperController
    participant DB as Database
    participant Storage as Laravel File Storage

    Student->>UI: Select final paper PDF
    UI->>Controller: POST /papers
    Controller->>DB: Verify approved subject/team membership
    Controller->>Controller: Validate PDF upload
    Controller->>Storage: Store paper PDF
    Controller->>DB: Create or update papers record
    DB-->>Controller: Paper saved as draft
    Controller-->>UI: Show upload confirmation
